---
import Figure from './Figure.astro';
---

<Figure caption="The server lists its refs, the client names what it wants and what it already has, and the server answers with one pack holding only the missing objects.">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="fetch-title">
    <title id="fetch-title">
      A sequence between client and server: the server advertises refs, the client sends want lines,
      then have lines; the server acknowledges a common commit and sends a pack.
    </title>
    <defs>
      <marker id="fn-arrow" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
        <path class="arrow" d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <rect class="box" x="40" y="10" width="120" height="30" rx="6" />
    <text x="100" y="30" text-anchor="middle">client</text>
    <rect class="box" x="480" y="10" width="120" height="30" rx="6" />
    <text x="540" y="30" text-anchor="middle">server</text>
    <path class="edge" d="M100 40 V 250" />
    <path class="edge" d="M540 40 V 250" />
    <path class="edge-strong" d="M540 70 H 104" marker-end="url(#fn-arrow)" />
    <text x="320" y="64" text-anchor="middle">refs: main → e5f6…, v1.0 → 99aa…</text>
    <path class="edge-strong" d="M100 110 H 536" marker-end="url(#fn-arrow)" />
    <text x="320" y="104" text-anchor="middle">want e5f6…</text>
    <path class="edge-strong" d="M100 150 H 536" marker-end="url(#fn-arrow)" />
    <text x="320" y="144" text-anchor="middle">have c3d4…, have a1b2…, done</text>
    <path class="edge-strong" d="M540 190 H 104" marker-end="url(#fn-arrow)" />
    <text x="320" y="184" text-anchor="middle">ACK c3d4… (common commit)</text>
    <rect class="box-quiet" x="230" y="210" width="180" height="30" rx="6" />
    <path class="edge-strong" d="M230 225 H 104" marker-end="url(#fn-arrow)" />
    <path class="edge" d="M540 225 H 410" />
    <text x="320" y="230" text-anchor="middle">pack: only what's missing</text>
  </svg>
</Figure>
